  "title": "Heart failure readmission risk",
  "turns": [
    {
      "jobId": "4faadb19-bbed-485b-bfab-35ed7a3c867a",
      "question": "Among our heart failure patients, which are most likely to be admitted to the hospital again in the next 30 days?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-04T04:39:47.605198Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-04T04:40:25.196501Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Based on the Kumo prediction from October 1, 2026, the heart failure patients with the highest estimated likelihood of an inpatient admission in the next 30 days are:\n\n| Patient ID | Likelihood of readmission in 30 days |\n|------------|--------------------------------------|\n| P001266 | 13.2% |\n| P000957 | 12.8% |\n| P000830 | 12.3% |\n| P001383 | 12.1% |\n| P000230 | 11.9% |\n| P000218 | 11.8% |\n| P000012 | 11.7% |\n| P000363 | 11.4% |\n| P000979 | 11.3% |\n| P000443 | 11.1% |\n| P000481 | 11.1% |\n| P001284 | 11.1% |\n| P001011 | 11.0% |\n| P000385 | 10.9% |\n| P000620 | 10.9% |\n| P000347 | 10.4% |\n| P001268 | 10.4% |\n| P000655 | 10.2% |\n| P000782 | 10.2% |\n| P000929 | 10.2% |\n| P000855 | 10.1% |\n| P001243 | 10.1% |\n| P001254 | 10.1% |\n| P000428 | 10.0% |\n| P000223 | 9.9% |\n\n[1]\n\n**Details:** The prediction covers 238 heart failure patients (`has_heart_failure = 1`), scored by a binary classification model estimating the probability of any inpatient encounter in the 30 days after the anchor date of **2026-10-01**. The table shows the top 25 patients by probability. These are model estimates, not certainties.\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] NVIDIA Kumo prediction result — healthcare.clinical — evidence `hermes-receipt:b47e9aeffd10d4ce9eac6c2722c8f5b53fd36707ec66e0eaa41bec429b966984`",
